  47:               disk ctlr-0-unit-1 dsk1

but now it shows:
  -1:           connection pci0slot8
  -4:             swxcr_controller xcr1
  -6:               control_port xcr1 scp0
  -7:               disk ctlr-1-unit-0 dsk0
  -8:               disk ctlr-1-unit-1 dsk1
Notice the "-" indicating an inactive device.

When I boot from an alternate root from an internal drive,
