Hello Admin wizards,

thanx to all who replied (in order of appearance):

Nikola Milutinovic, Peter Reynolds, Stan Horowitz, Jon Norstog, Wolfgang 
Rupp, Kyle McKee, Joseph Senulis, Peter Gerger and finally Ram Rao.

