the alpha machines directly.

5) I was pointed to some online vendors who still have this equipment on 
stock, especially www.crucial.com, www.cpuoptions.com and www.kingston.com

I always thought I had the last two up and running "dinos" of these old 
Alpha 1000 machines .... it is good to see that there is still company 
out there. Thank you all again, especially to you, Wilfried.



