1. There is no single list of supported hardware for tru64.
2. The best one can do is check the release notes for each version of tru64
for retired products.  These at least are placed in a consistent place, in
chapter 2, of the release notes.
3. Regarding the specific scsi controller I was looking into, the kzpsc-xx,
it was no longer supported as of version 5.0. The kzpac- controller,
however, is still supported.
4. Not supported does not mean the same thing as 'will not work.' The
hardware may well work fine, but the people who support tru64 will no longer
support the product.

Thanks to Bryan Lavelle, Ram Rao, Peter Gergen, and two other people whose
response I picked up at my office machine but whose names I don't have on
hand right now.

Mike Cochran




