Thanks to Dr. Thomas Blinn and Alan Rollow, who have indicated the =
following:

1.Those systems in the menu have nothing to do with DS20.
2.DS20 has ISA only, so you have to use RCM's isacfg utility, not ECU =
diskette.
3. The supported graphics adapters for
	the DS20E are:

	Powerstorm 300
	Powerstorm 350
	3D Labs Oxygen VX1
	Powerstorm 4D51T
	Elsa Gloria Synergy

So, following their advice I have swapped the ISA card with Elsa Gloria =
from another box.
Another box (AS255) was quite happy with ISA and the resolution =
sufficed.

Lots of praises to this board.

